{
  "archived": true,
  "blobPath": "year=2024/month=12/rec123.json",
  "checksum": "ae34fdd..."
}


2. Blob Read Failures
Risk: Blob Storage might be throttled or temporarily unavailable.

Impact: Archived records become inaccessible.

Mitigation & Fix:

Retry logic with exponential backoff when fetching from blob.

Set Azure CDN or Azure Front Door in front of Blob Storage to cache archived data.

Optionally cache frequently accessed archived records in Redis.

